<div class="hf-row">
<div class="hf-cell TOCLink"><a href="#toc" style="font-weight: initial; font-style: initial; font-variant: initial; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">Table of Contents</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;"><b>Fees Billed to QuickLogic by the Company's Audit Firms During</b><b>&#160;Fiscal Year</b>&#160;<b>2025&#160;and During&#160;Fiscal Year 2024</b></p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;text-indent:27pt;">Both Frank, Rimerman + Co. LLP,&#160;the Company&#8217;s independent registered public accounting firm, and Moss Adams (now Baker Tilly), the Company&#8217;s predecessor audit firm until June 4, 2024, billed QuickLogic for the following professional services during the fiscal years&#160;2025&#160;and 2024&#160;as noted in the table below:</p>

