			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">the results of the&#160;2025&#160;independent audit of the consolidated financial statements and review of the Annual Report on Form&#160;10&#8209;K and Proxy Statement;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

