			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">the ability and responsibility to institute special investigations, if necessary, and obtain advice and assistance from independent outside legal, accounting, or other services, with funding from the Company;</p>
			</td>
