<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b><a id="outstandingequity" title="outstandingequity" href="#"></a>OUTSTANDING EQUITY AWARDS AT FISCAL YEAR END</b></p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b>FOR FISCAL YEAR ENDED DECEMBER 28, 2025</b></p>

